Subject: [PATCH 68/70] Switch 2: English by default with French and
 Portuguese, official UZDoom colours

- nx2_lang: language of the port's own screens (loading screen, fatal
  errors, Vulkan failure), from the launcher's -nxlang switch or read only
  from config/launcher.json; English by default.
- Loading screen texts and tips in English, French and Portuguese.
- Loading screen colours from the official UZDoom colour guide.
- Comments in English; UZDoom instead of GZDoom in the port's comments.

